Error handling

Refactor jl_itoa and jl_htoa to use lookup tables

jl_itoa: 
.section .rodata
lookup_table:
    .asciz "0123456789"

jl_htoa: 
.section .rodata
lookup_table:
    .asciz "0123456789ABCDEF"

using it would be like:
adr x15, lookup_table           // address to lookup table
ldrb w10, [x15, w10, uxtw]      // w10 contains the index (the rest from division)

More asserts:
ASSERT_EQ_INT
ASSERT_EQ_UINT
ASSERT_EQ_SIZE


